.TH SHB-SESSIONS 1 "October 2026" "SecretHarbor 0.4.0-prod" "SecretHarbor Manual"
.SH NAME
shb-sessions \- List active SecretHarbor sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBshb sessions\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
Lists all currently active SecretHarbor-managed agent sessions across projects with their session IDs, agent types, and process PIDs.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
$ \fBshb sessions\fR
.SH SEE ALSO
shb(1)
.SH WEBSITE
https://secretharbor.dev
